@startuml
!includeurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/refs/heads/main/proveo.iuml
title OpenClaw — local persistent personal agent
' Product: OpenClaw
' URL: https://openclaw.ai/
' Level: 4
' Formerly: 4-harness/anti-framework/hands.puml — the old filename named an approach ("hands"), not the
'           subject, which made a file about OpenClaw the least findable one in the tree.
' Note: openclaw.ai verified live 2026-09, still under its own name, with no rename language. It is a
'       DISTINCT project from Hermes Agent (NousResearch) — the hermes-agent README offers a
'       "Migrating from OpenClaw" import path for settings/skills, which is a migration route, not a
'       rebrand. Hermes has its own study-case at 4-harness/self-improving/skill-library-flywheel.puml.

package "OpenClaw Architecture" {
    [Chat Interface\n(Slack/Gmail/Browser/HuggingFace)] as UI
    [OpenClaw Core\n(Persistent Memory & Loop)] as CORE
    [LLM Provider\n(Anthropic/OpenAI/Local)] as LLM
    [Skills & Plugins\n(Hackable/Self-Writing)] as SKILLS
    [System Access\n(Bash/Files/Browser)] as IO
}

actor User

User <--> UI : "Natural Language Command"
UI <--> CORE : "Message Stream"

CORE <--> LLM : "Reasoning & Tool Selection"
CORE <--> SKILLS : "Load/Generate Skills"

CORE --> IO : "Direct Environment Manipulation"
note bottom of IO
  "Eyes and hands at a desk."
  Executes real commands on the
  host machine (Mac/Win/Linux).
end note

IO --> CORE : "Observation / Result"

note right of CORE
  Runs locally.
  Maintains 24/7 context.
end note

@enduml
